### ping — testa conectividade + assinatura + saúde do engine
# Assine o body com HMAC-SHA256 de `${timestamp}.${body}` usando <SEGREDO_COMPARTILHADO>.
POST https://alteapay.com/api/webhooks/n8n
Content-Type: application/json
x-alteapay-signature: <HMAC_HEX>
x-alteapay-timestamp: <EPOCH_SEGUNDOS>

{ "action": "ping" }

### Resposta esperada
# 200 { "success": true, "service": "alteapay-chatbot", "engine": { "ok": true, "engine": "n8n" } }
